  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bicycles for Mobility SBAR Pilot</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The activity seeks to increase mobility in rural areas in sub-Saharan Africa by developing and demonstrating means to rapidly increase bicycle uptake for individuals who cannot afford or do not have access to other transportation  thereby facilitating the opportunity for higher incomes, and better health and education outcomes.</narrative>
  </description>
